00:11:55.381 --> 00:11:58.584 align:start size:97% position:3%
But I remember two
instances, this is classic.

00:11:58.584 --> 00:12:03.489
I remember I was, we had a vote.

00:12:04.990 --> 00:12:06.859
Nothing has changed
