Africa if we do that."

00:12:48.801 --> 00:12:51.270
So he voted, okay,
a different way.

00:12:51.270 --> 00:12:52.238
But here's the key.

00:12:52.238 --> 00:12:53.539
The next day in the dining hall,

00:12:53.539 --> 00:12:55.207
