00:13:58.304 --> 00:14:00.239 align:start size:88% position:13%
So I remember-
- You can't imagine why.

00:14:00.239 --> 00:14:01.941 align:start size:84% position:16%
- Choosing one of
Lennon and thinking,

00:14:01.941 --> 00:14:03.375
"Well, that sort of looks okay."

00:14:03.375 --> 00:14:05.711 align:start size:97% position:3%
And I put it up, I was living
