00:14:14.420 --> 00:14:16.222
And it suddenly dawned on me.

00:14:16.222 --> 00:14:17.723
My father said,

00:14:17.723 --> 00:14:20.826 align:start size:94% position:6%
"I wanna ask you favor,
would you take that down?"

00:14:20.826 --> 00:14:23.095 align:start size:88% position:13%
And it was as if the
scales fell from my eyes

00:14:23.095 --> 00:14:26.332
and I realized, what
has happened to me.

00:14:26.332 --> 00:14:27.566 align:start size:84% position:16%
There are a hundred
other examples

00:14:27.566 --> 00:14:30.069
