moments that I remember

00:14:30.069 --> 00:14:33.005
suddenly coming to
myself and thinking,

00:14:33.005 --> 00:14:36.308 align:start size:97% position:3%
how is it possible that I
thought it was okay to do that

00:14:36.308 --> 00:14:39.245 align:start size:88% position:13%
when my father raised
me to despise communism,

00:14:40.579 --> 00:14:43.949 align:start size:97% position:3%
the Solzhenitsyn and
Buckley despised communism?

00:14:45.050 --> 00:14:46.185 align:start size:88% position:13%
- So what's interesting
about this to me,

00:14:46.185 --> 00:14:47.419
there's couple of things

00:14:47.419 --> 00:14:48.754
