00:15:03.168 --> 00:15:05.905
What years were you in college?

00:15:05.905 --> 00:15:07.806
- I was there, I
graduated in '84.

00:15:07.806 --> 00:15:09.408
But it was in full swing.

00:15:09.408 --> 00:15:11.277
It was in full swing
