00:30:10.408 --> 00:30:13.678
So there's no question about it.

00:30:13.678 --> 00:30:15.046
And again, there
are degrees of this

00:30:15.046 --> 00:30:16.915
depending on who you talk to,

00:30:16.915 --> 00:30:18.917
but there are certain
things, you know this,

00:30:18.917 --> 00:30:22.854 align:start size:94% position:6%
that are simply not spoken
of in certain places

00:30:22.854 --> 00:30:25.890
and faculty lounges
at places like Yale,

00:30:25.890 --> 00:30:28.927
