Times boardroom,

00:30:28.927 --> 00:30:31.129
and on and on and on and on,

00:30:31.129 --> 00:30:32.564
they're, not gonna
touch that stuff.

00:30:32.564 --> 00:30:34.933 align:start size:94% position:6%
They have been very happy
to allow the culture

00:30:34.933 --> 00:30:37.435
to become dramatically secular.

00:30:38.937 --> 00:30:40.605
- All right, so then this is
