00:31:05.964 --> 00:31:07.432
No, I'll tell you what,

00:31:07.432 --> 00:31:10.034 align:start size:94% position:6%
I've written 30 children's
books over the years.

00:31:10.034 --> 00:31:11.302 align:start size:84% position:16%
But I've also written
a lot of humor.

00:31:11.302 --> 00:31:14.739
I was the editor of the
