00:33:05.817 --> 00:33:08.853 align:start size:94% position:6%
The thing with my book,
"Donald Drains the Swamp",

00:33:08.853 --> 00:33:10.521
I just happen to
have a copy here,

00:33:10.521 --> 00:33:15.526
"Donald Drains the Swamp," is
that even though it's aimed

00:33:16.894 --> 00:33:19.597 align:start size:94% position:6%
at adults because there's
sophisticated humor,

00:33:19.597 --> 00:33:21.532
for example, the turtle

00:33:21.532 --> 00:33:23.368
