like Mitch McConnell.

00:33:23.368 --> 00:33:24.902
That's a coincidence
'cause all turtles

00:33:24.902 --> 00:33:26.404
look like Mitch McConnell.
- It's not a coincidence.

00:33:26.404 --> 00:33:28.139
- But the point is that
when you're talking about

00:33:28.139 --> 00:33:30.975
the swamp and all of
this, there's a lot
of political humor.

00:33:30.975 --> 00:33:35.113
But because there's
nothing nasty in it,

00:33:35.113 --> 00:33:36.714
it works for kids.

00:33:36.714 --> 00:33:38.516
So people often say
