00:33:38.516 --> 00:33:39.751
It's a kid's book.

00:33:39.751 --> 00:33:41.886 align:start size:84% position:16%
Technically, it's
an adult humor book,

00:33:41.886 --> 00:33:43.855
it's a novelty book,
