00:33:45.323 --> 00:33:46.424
Kids aren't gonna get the jokes.

00:33:46.424 --> 00:33:48.459
They don't know who AOC is,

00:33:48.459 --> 00:33:49.594
and they don't know

00:33:49.594 --> 00:33:51.562 align:start size:88% position:13%
that Bernie is a
communist and they're...

00:33:51.562 --> 00:33:52.797 align:start size:84% position:16%
So we've written
three of these books.

00:33:52.797 --> 00:33:56.401
But a big reason that
we did them, as I said,

00:33:56.401 --> 00:33:59.370 align:start size:97% position:3%
the one thing we conservatives
