00:34:08.846 --> 00:34:10.548
The left really has,

00:34:10.548 --> 00:34:12.450 align:start size:84% position:16%
the long march through
the institutions,

00:34:12.450 --> 00:34:15.253 align:start size:84% position:16%
academia, publishing,
journalism,

00:34:15.253 --> 00:34:16.921
it's all very, very leftist.

00:34:16.921 --> 00:34:19.924 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I said, I wanna create
something that's fun

00:34:19.924 --> 00:34:22.193
for people who actually
liked this president.

00:34:22.193 --> 00:34:24.495 align:start size:84% position:16%
And of course the
reason he's a Caveman

00:34:24.495 --> 00:34:25.430
is meant to be funny.

00:34:25.430 --> 00:34:26.864
