00:34:29.867 --> 00:34:32.904 align:start position:0%
They don't know that you're
not supposed to do it that way.

00:34:32.904 --> 00:34:34.205
They just wanna fix the problem,

00:34:34.205 --> 00:34:35.773
like they're good guys
and they just do it.

00:34:35.773 --> 00:34:38.709
So it's not really
making fun of him,

00:34:38.709 --> 00:34:40.745
but there's a lightness to it

00:34:40.745 --> 00:34:43.614
for people who think of him
as somewhat of a Caveman.

00:34:43.614 --> 00:34:47.285
- But Metaxas, I can see
