00:35:03.367 --> 00:35:05.069
It's rather simple.

00:35:06.671 --> 00:35:09.340
Look, the idea that...

00:35:10.708 --> 00:35:12.677
I think you know this,

00:35:12.677 --> 00:35:16.180
that there are people, and we
