00:35:41.973 --> 00:35:43.074
- And it's definitely racist.

00:35:43.074 --> 00:35:44.075
It's also racist,

00:35:44.075 --> 00:35:45.576 align:start size:75% position:25%
one plus one.
- And it's also,

00:35:45.576 --> 00:35:47.078 line:0%
