00:35:59.123 --> 00:36:01.759
Cause there was that,
Contra Trump about him

00:36:01.759 --> 00:36:03.494 align:start size:88% position:13%
not remembering
something for the Bible.

00:36:03.494 --> 00:36:05.830
I found the whole
thing hilarious.

00:36:05.830 --> 00:36:10.701
And so I did a whole thing
