00:36:14.572 --> 00:36:16.274 align:start size:94% position:6%
I wonder if I can remember
any of them right now,

00:36:16.274 --> 00:36:20.845
but like a good wife who
can find, I found three.

00:36:20.845 --> 00:36:23.981 align:start size:97% position:3%
Whatever, and there was
just all these Bible verses

00:36:23.981 --> 00:36:26.250
that we have some dim memory of,

00:36:26.250 --> 00:36:29.020
and then sort of a
Trumphication of it.

00:36:29.020 --> 00:36:31.222 align:start size:97% position:3%
Anyway, while I was writing
it for The New Yorker,

00:36:31.222 --> 00:36:35.993
this is totally true, I found
myself almost like a comedian,

00:36:35.993 --> 00:36:37.695 align:start size:84% position:16%
because I have written
a lot of comedy,

00:36:37.695 --> 00:36:40.031
like you're writing for a voice.

00:36:40.031 --> 00:36:41.265
Like I'm writing for Bob Hope

00:36:41.265 --> 00:36:42.700
or I'm writing for Jackie Mason

00:36:42.700 --> 00:36:45.970 align:start position:0%
and you kind of find that
