00:36:45.970 --> 00:36:49.807 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I found myself having
an affection for him

00:36:49.807 --> 00:36:51.943
in the way that you
would for an uncle

00:36:51.943 --> 00:36:56.547 align:start size:84% position:16%
